%% aoneahsan-cccs-debugging — full flow
flowchart TD
    trigger([Bug / failure / 403 / silent no-op]) --> law{Root cause found yet?}
    law -->|no| p1[Phase 1 — Root cause:<br/>read full error, reproduce,<br/>git diff, instrument boundaries,<br/>trace bad value to source]
    law -->|"tempted to just patch it"| p1

    p1 --> repro{Reproduces<br/>consistently?}
    repro -->|no| gather[Gather more data —<br/>do NOT guess a fix]
    gather --> p1
    repro -->|yes| p2[Phase 2 — Pattern:<br/>find working example,<br/>read reference fully]

    p2 --> p3[Phase 3 — Hypothesis:<br/>state the specific cause<br/>+ the single fix + why]
    p3 --> multi{Rules / permission /<br/>integration failure?}
    multi -->|yes| probe[Live-probe: same request twice,<br/>change ONE variable, compare 403 vs 200.<br/>Seed data first · Origin-only · as non-admin]
    multi -->|no| fix
    probe --> fix[Phase 4 — Fix at the SOURCE<br/>minimal change]

    fix --> verify{Verify vs the ORIGINAL symptom<br/>aoneahsan-cccs-verification.<br/>Green build is NOT proof;<br/>fire-and-forget needs a live call}
    verify -->|still fails| p1
    verify -->|symptom gone, evidence shown| done([Fixed at root, proven])

    probe -.consult if present.-> reg[(../rules/data-fetch-budget.md<br/>fileshub-api.md)]

    classDef gate fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    classDef warn fill:#fef2f2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    class law,repro,multi,verify gate
    class trigger,done terminal
    class gather warn
